# Reap per-transcode FFmpeg.*.log files older than 14d. Jellyfin core writes
# one per stream into /var/log/jellyfin; they are the only files there
# because logging.default.json drops the Serilog File sink. No leading "~"
# on the age: it would limit cleanup to the second level and skip these
# files, which sit directly in the directory.
#
# Type Path              Mode UID GID Age Argument
e      /var/log/jellyfin -    -   -   14d -
